<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain sees 150 mln dinar 97/98 budget deficit.</title>
<headline>Bahrain sees 150 mln dinar 97/98 budget deficit.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain on Tuesday forecast a 150 million dinar deficit in its 1997/98 calendar two-year budget.</p>
<p>Income in the 1997/98 budget is forecast at 1.245 billion dinars with expenditure forecast at 1.395 billion dinars, according to a decree issued by the Emir, Sheikh Isa bin Sulman al-Khalifa and carried by the official Gulf News Agency.</p>
</text>
